  "meaning": "A being c that is different from a contingent x, exists at w, and causes x's esse is also the distinct cause that B2 requires. The existing First Way necessity proof consumes B2 on the same f and same frame; this projection does not establish R1 or an actual giver, and must not be counted as another independent argument for necessity.",
